WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.222
These two tables represent the same simplified information.

00:00:04.222 --> 00:00:08.432
The long table has one product-month per row.

00:00:08.432 --> 00:00:13.372
The wide table has one product per row.

00:00:13.372 --> 00:00:16.817
Before reshaping, state both grains clearly.

00:00:16.817 --> 00:00:24.282
That makes it easier to identify what has changed and whether any information has been aggregated away.

00:00:24.282 --> 00:00:33.132
Long and wide are not labels for good and bad design; they are shapes suited to different tasks.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:37.432
Long data is often easier for grouping, plotting, and scalable storage.

00:00:37.432 --> 00:00:45.827
Wide data is often convenient for human-readable reports or some modeling interfaces.

00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:48.640
Choose the shape required by the next step.
